        "detailed_description": "<h1>✨ Arcane Afterfall Update: Bug Fixes, Improvements &amp; Exciting Changes Ahead! 🔮</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔮 Hey everyone! Thank you for your active feedback – we carefully read all your comments and suggestions, and it's because of you that Arcane Afterfall keeps getting better with every update!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚒️ What’s new?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- We’ve fixed multiple bugs to make the game more stable and enjoyable for all players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Added a location map to help you more easily navigate the world that has lost its magic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Faction restrictions in the Arcane Tower have been removed – groups are now formed solely based on player levels: 9-12, 13-16, 17-19, 20+. This change will help you take on challenges more easily</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You can now discard unnecessary quest items if the associated quest is not in your journal – no more cluttered inventory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- System messages that previously might have appeared in the wrong language will now be displayed in the selected language.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ What’s next?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re already working on new updates with exciting improvements and content. Stay tuned to be the first to know about upcoming changes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💬 Share your thoughts, let us know what you love and what could be improved – your feedback truly matters to us!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Welcome to Arcane Afterfall – a role-playing game inspired by the classics of the genre, where magic no longer reigns, and those who dream of restoring it must fight for their cause. This is a world where people from Earth arrived in search of the last drop of magical energy-only to discover new mysteries, ancient threats, and the struggle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/ac954e6ff6f66d9c5d64ff4fa0277050.poster.avif?t=1777282475\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/ac954e6ff6f66d9c5d64ff4fa0277050.webm?t=1777282475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/ac954e6ff6f66d9c5d64ff4fa0277050.mp4?t=1777282475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔍 Explore a mysterious world filled with intrigue and unexpected encounters. Join secret organizations, solve riddles, and hunt for rare Easter eggs 🎭 hidden in the most unexpected places. Here, every choice has consequences, and knowledge is power 📖✨.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TACTICAL BATTLES AND DEADLY ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 The Arcane Afterfall combat system is designed for true strategists. Turn-based battles require a thoughtful approach-use unique abilities ⚡, combine talents, analyze enemy weaknesses, and find vulnerabilities 🎯 to gain the upper hand, even in the most challenging fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/e9448beb50b5b01e43d640f38f339a88.poster.avif?t=1777282475\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/e9448beb50b5b01e43d640f38f339a88.webm?t=1777282475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/e9448beb50b5b01e43d640f38f339a88.mp4?t=1777282475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👹 But the real trials await you in boss fights. Gigantic demons 😈, ancient artifact-bound entities 🔮, and mechanical titans 🤖-each boss requires a unique strategy. Defeating them grants legendary rewards 🏆, but to triumph, you must rely not only on strength but also on cunning 🧠.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/6554c43aedaf56236266419991282c7c.poster.avif?t=1777282475\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/6554c43aedaf56236266419991282c7c.webm?t=1777282475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/6554c43aedaf56236266419991282c7c.mp4?t=1777282475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DUNGEONS, PVP, AND THE &quot;TOWER OF ARCANA&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Venture into dark dungeons-alone or with a group. Every labyrinth holds its own secrets and deadly traps ☠️, and in its depths, powerful bosses and treasures 💎 await. For those who enjoy battling other players, PvP arenas are open, where you can test your skills in team fights 🏅. And in the Tower of Arcana, you’ll start with no equipment and must find different ways to emerge victorious-only your skill determines the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/effa2338dca29c779aa227b825eb5dcd.poster.avif?t=1777282475\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/effa2338dca29c779aa227b825eb5dcd.webm?t=1777282475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/effa2338dca29c779aa227b825eb5dcd.mp4?t=1777282475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORLD FULL OF MYSTERIES AND POSSIBILITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔮 Unravel the secrets of the nameless City by penetrating its Inside Out. Challenge the Shaved Sisters gang or become a paladin of the Last Order. Become a warrior of the Swamp Legion or set out to explore Zone 51 👽. Discover what lies hidden within the Confluxion and find your way through space and time in star sneakers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/13e8da8b28220d3a30401ad25034fc74.poster.avif?t=1777282475\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/13e8da8b28220d3a30401ad25034fc74.webm?t=1777282475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/13e8da8b28220d3a30401ad25034fc74.mp4?t=1777282475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s always something to do in Arcane Afterfall - explore, fight, solve mysteries, and become part of a great story!</p>",
