_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/effa2338dca29c779aa227b825eb5dcd.poster.avif?t=1777282475\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/effa2338dca29c779aa227b825eb5dcd.webm?t=1777282475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/effa2338dca29c779aa227b825eb5dcd.mp4?t=1777282475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORLD FULL OF MYSTERIES AND POSSIBILITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔮 Unravel the secrets of the nameless City by penetrating its Inside Out. Challenge the Shaved Sisters gang or become a paladin of the Last Order. Become a warrior of the Swamp Legion or set out to explore Zone 51 👽. Discover what lies hidden within the Confluxion and find your way through space and time in star sneakers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/13e8da8b28220d3a30401ad25034fc74.poster.avif?t=1777282475\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/13e8da8b28220d3a30401ad25034fc74.webm?t=1777282475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/13e8da8b28220d3a30401ad25034fc74.mp4?t=1777282475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s always something to do in Arcane Afterfall - explore, fight, solve mysteries, and become part of a great story!</p>",
